WEBVTT

00:31:29.542 --> 00:31:32.768
CF: Saudi Arabia, it has one single export

00:31:32.792 --> 00:31:34.559
which is fossil fuels, oil and gas.

00:31:34.583 --> 00:31:38.476
They came out of poverty
when they discovered fossil fuels,

00:31:38.500 --> 00:31:40.934
and they are one of the richest
nations of the world

00:31:40.958 --> 00:31:42.893
because of fossil fuels.

00:31:42.917 --> 00:31:44.601
AG: On one of her many trips there,

00:31:44.625 --> 00:31:46.143
she visited an oil field

00:31:46.167 --> 00:31:48.393
and was on a plane
with the minister of energy

00:31:48.417 --> 00:31:50.976
and the head negotiator for Saudi Arabia.

00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:54.893
One of them pulled out a napkin
and started drawing out a plan.

00:31:54.917 --> 00:32:00.268
CF: The idea of the need
to have economic diversification